The Acts	Acts	51	10	32	Send therefore to Joppe, and call hither Simon, who is surnamed Peter: he lodgeth in the house of Simon a tanner, by the sea side.
The Acts	Acts	51	10	33	Immediately therefore I sent to thee: and thou hast done well in coming. Now therefore all we are present in thy sight, to hear all things whatsoever are commanded thee by the Lord.
The Acts	Acts	51	10	34	And Peter opening his mouth, said: In very deed I perceive, that God is not a respecter of persons.
